# Jetson の電源(INA3221 の電圧・電流)と温度を読むだけの記録係。2026-10-30 ユーザーの決め「起動で自動に始める」(user_decisions.md)。
# sysfs(/sys/class/hwmon・/sys/class/thermal)を読むだけ。1 秒に 10 回・1 秒ごとに保存(電源が切れる直前の値を残すため)。
# 入れ方: sudo cp tools/systemd/jetformer-power.service /etc/systemd/system/ && sudo systemctl daemon-reload
#         && sudo systemctl enable --now jetformer-power     止める: sudo systemctl disable --now jetformer-power
[Unit]
Description=JetFormer power and temperature logger (read-only sysfs)
After=multi-user.target

[Service]
Type=simple
User=jetson
Group=jetson
WorkingDirectory=/home/jetson/jetformer
Environment=PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1
ExecStart=/home/jetson/miniconda/envs/jetracer/bin/python -I -u /home/jetson/jetformer/tools/power_logger.py --hz 10 --fsync-s 1 --rotate-s 1800
Nice=10
Restart=on-failure
RestartSec=10
TimeoutStopSec=10

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
